    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Restyle any video\n\nLoad a clip you already rendered (MiniMax H3, LTX, Seedance, live action) and give it the Deforum / AnimateDiff / Disco look: an image model re-paints every frame, with the previous painted frame carried along the clip's own motion.\n\n- `style`: deforum morph, animatediff boil, disco flicker, clean restyle, custom.\n- `denoise` 0.3 keeps the clip, 0.6 re-imagines it; `cadence 2` halves the time.\n- The audio and fps of the source are kept. **Upscale 2K** on a switch."
   ]
  },
